    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, i should call the doc but they're super hard to get ahold of and i'm always waiting weeks for an appointment. it's just making me so uncomfortable right now. like, i just want some relief from the cramping. if i don't take a huge amount, like just a little bit of the 99mg ones once or twice a day, is that really gonna be that dangerous? it's just such a small dose right?",
